usage: run_apk_size_experiment.py [-h] --commit COMMIT --out OUT --sdk SDK
                                  [--gradle GRADLE] [--http-proxy]
                                  [--stop-idle-kotlin-daemon]

Build four unsigned fullRelease packages in detached, external worktrees.
Never signs, installs, uploads, changes production Gradle, or cleans user
data. Stops on the first build/manifest/ABI failure and persists partial
evidence.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --commit COMMIT       Full pinned Git commit SHA
  --out OUT
  --sdk SDK
  --gradle GRADLE
  --http-proxy          Use inherited HTTPS_PROXY for Java network requests
  --stop-idle-kotlin-daemon
                        For a dedicated small-memory environment, stop the
                        experiment-local idle compiler when R8 starts
